sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User as User Browser
    participant FE as FireFly Frontend
    participant API as Next.js API Route
    participant Auth as Better-Auth
    participant Postgres as PostgreSQL
    participant Okta as Okta IDP
    participant SPN as SPN Token Service
    participant Databricks as Databricks APIs

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over User,FE: User Action
        User->>FE: Click "View Catalog"
        FE->>FE: Check local cache
        FE->>API: GET /api/catalog/catalogs<br/>Cookie: session_token=xxx
    end

    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
        Note over API,Okta: User Session Validation
        API->>Auth: getSession(request)
        Auth->>Postgres: SELECT * FROM session<br/>WHERE token = 'xxx'
        Postgres-->>Auth: Session + user + org data
        Auth->>Auth: Check session expiry
        opt Validate with Okta
            Auth->>Okta: Verify user token
            Okta-->>Auth: Token valid
        end
        Auth-->>API: SessionContext { userId, orgId, ... }
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over API,Databricks: SPN Token Retrieval
        API->>Postgres: Get org.servicePrincipal config
        Postgres-->>API: SPN clientId + encrypted secret
        API->>SPN: Get/refresh SPN token

        alt SPN Token Expired or Missing
            SPN->>SPN: Decrypt client secret
            SPN->>Databricks: POST /oidc/v1/token<br/>grant_type=client_credentials
            Note right of SPN: client_id + client_secret
            Databricks-->>SPN: Access Token (1hr TTL)
            SPN->>SPN: Encrypt new token
            SPN->>Postgres: Cache SPN token
        end

        SPN-->>API: SPN Bearer Token
    end

    rect rgb(255, 255, 240)
        Note over API,Databricks: Databricks API Call
        API->>Databricks: GET /api/2.1/unity-catalog/catalogs<br/>Authorization: Bearer {spn_token}
        Databricks->>Databricks: Validate SPN token
        Databricks->>Databricks: Check SPN permissions
        Databricks-->>API: { catalogs: [...] }
    end

    rect rgb(248, 248, 255)
        Note over FE,Postgres: Response & Caching
        API->>Postgres: Optional: cache response
        API-->>FE: JSON Response
        FE->>FE: Update TanStack Query cache
        FE->>User: Render catalog list
    end
